<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>环境迁移 on keyboard blog</title><link>https://blog.keyboard2005.net/tags/%E7%8E%AF%E5%A2%83%E8%BF%81%E7%A7%BB/</link><description>Recent content in 环境迁移 on keyboard blog</description><generator>Hugo -- gohugo.io</generator><language>zh-cn</language><lastBuildDate>Sat, 31 Jan 2026 03:18:00 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://blog.keyboard2005.net/tags/%E7%8E%AF%E5%A2%83%E8%BF%81%E7%A7%BB/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>conda默认不激活base环境命令</title><link>https://blog.keyboard2005.net/posts/2026/01/conda%E9%BB%98%E8%AE%A4%E4%B8%8D%E6%BF%80%E6%B4%BBbase%E7%8E%AF%E5%A2%83/</link><pubDate>Sat, 31 Jan 2026 03:18:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://blog.keyboard2005.net/posts/2026/01/conda%E9%BB%98%E8%AE%A4%E4%B8%8D%E6%BF%80%E6%B4%BBbase%E7%8E%AF%E5%A2%83/</guid><description>&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;"&gt;&lt;code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash"&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;conda config --set auto_activate_base false
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</description></item><item><title>conda 导出环境（conda-pack）</title><link>https://blog.keyboard2005.net/posts/2025/conda%E5%AF%BC%E5%87%BA%E7%8E%AF%E5%A2%83/</link><pubDate>Wed, 07 Jan 2026 19:15:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://blog.keyboard2005.net/posts/2025/conda%E5%AF%BC%E5%87%BA%E7%8E%AF%E5%A2%83/</guid><description>&lt;h1 id="conda-导出环境conda-pack"&gt;conda 导出环境（conda-pack）
&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;用 &lt;code&gt;conda-pack&lt;/code&gt; 将已有环境打包，拷贝到另一台机器后解包并执行 &lt;code&gt;conda-unpack&lt;/code&gt; 完成修复。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id="1-安装-conda-pack"&gt;1. 安装 conda-pack
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;"&gt;&lt;code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash"&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;conda install -n base -c conda-forge conda-pack
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2 id="2-打包环境"&gt;2. 打包环境
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;"&gt;&lt;code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash"&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;conda pack -n openmmlab_env -o openmmlab_env.tar.gz
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2 id="3-迁移并解包"&gt;3. 迁移并解包
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;将 &lt;code&gt;openmmlab_env.tar.gz&lt;/code&gt; 拷贝到目标机器，解压到 &lt;code&gt;envs/&lt;/code&gt; 目录后执行：&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;"&gt;&lt;code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash"&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;envs/openmmlab_env/bin/conda-unpack
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>